{"id":5730,"date":"2025-09-26T08:56:58","date_gmt":"2025-09-26T01:56:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5730"},"modified":"2025-09-26T08:56:58","modified_gmt":"2025-09-26T01:56:58","slug":"cach-dang-ky-ban-hang-tren-shopee","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-shopee\/cach-dang-ky-ban-hang-tren-shopee\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"RYi6dCL2mooKmqxnzUMl6SnFgwe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IPykdnbWBoS1RCxdsNslYNp2guf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang c\u00f3 \u00fd \u0111\u1ecbnh kinh doanh online, ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng nh\u1ea5t. Tuy nhi\u00ean, nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\u1eabn l\u00fang t\u00fang kh\u00f4ng bi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb \u0111\u00e2u. \u0110\u1eebng lo l\u1eafng! B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea1n c\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 chi ti\u1ebft, t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc m\u1ed9t. Lemon s\u1ebd c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n \u0111i qua c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng \u0111o\u1ea1n quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t nh\u01b0 t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng cho h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CVIBd7Sf1oWvd5xWK6xljIxGgLf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Ykd0dvzoSoxNNqxoU6mlWo5Jgwc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Azb7dyQueoy8NnxZeefl7lDKgLd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh tr\u00ean Shopee, vi\u1ec7c chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ecdi vi\u1ec7c su\u00f4n s\u1ebb, kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb gi\u00e1n \u0111o\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PgFzdpNltowbd7xiSTWlxloTgme\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee v\u00e0 truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o <strong>K\u00eanh Ng\u01b0\u1eddi B\u00e1n<\/strong>. N\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a c\u00f3, b\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u1eb1ng s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LUtEdnSffodbdrxQjm2l1EihgNe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sau \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n g\u1ed3m: C\u0103n c\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00f4ng d\u00e2n (\u0111\u1ec3 Shopee x\u00e1c minh danh t\u00ednh), s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn ti\u1ec1n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VT58dfuJwoDsctxNKlFlxklZglf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i n\u1eafm r\u00f5 m\u1ed9t v\u00e0i quy \u0111\u1ecbnh quan tr\u1ecdng. H\u00e3y t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u k\u1ef9 v\u1ec1 <strong>ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ea5m\/h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/strong> c\u1ee7a Shopee \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLudddAd3ovQtLxIACPlCkO9gxb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng, \u0111\u1eebng qu\u00ean ki\u1ec3m tra <strong>quota \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n <\/strong>(s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1ed1i \u0111a m\u00e0 Shop c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n tr\u00ean Shopee) c\u1ee7a shop \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u00ecnh c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZiegdfCPHoY9zexITgslwFDDgGc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm r\u00f5 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd nhanh ch\u00f3ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n t\u1ea1o n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc cho vi\u1ec7c kinh doanh l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Ql5EdPBe8owTN4x61xMlPM1EgZc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;cc04ec31-02c8-4709-84bb-3c9a7d7c9cee&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FBkLTbyhv8oJWUexX3TllZQXTgLf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;BkLTbyhv8oJWUexX3TllZQXTgLf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1006078,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5739 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMEjdyHb3ocWD0xhkvMlvCiEguf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MgpJdoq16oGejcx2h0ilYH2ogOc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn 5 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee chi ti\u1ebft<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qhp8dDlLaoiOG6x4Pi4l5Kbpgih\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i ch\u1edd l\u00e2u h\u01a1n n\u1eefa, d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 5 b\u01b0\u1edbc chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-NZLjdfz3ToSpXbx5zUplCG3GgYd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VpyBdJuicodDTtxPccRluH9UgQg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee. N\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng lu\u00f4n s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd l\u00e0m ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n. C\u00f2n n\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a, h\u00e3y t\u1ea3i \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee v\u1ec1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u1eb1ng s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nkc2dplIdofWHyxwfBNlmMu6gcc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd g\u1eedi m\u00e3 x\u00e1c minh (m\u00e3 OTP) v\u1ec1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n nh\u1eadp \u0111\u00fang m\u00e3 l\u00e0 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o xong trong t\u00edch t\u1eafc. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean v\u00e0 c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-ML3wdS4pNobTTmxCWzall315gMe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;61809d16-8694-4643-8228-59f5f36c8959&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FHnfHbhD4LobhadxCyEllCnF1gtc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;HnfHbhD4LobhadxCyEllCnF1gtc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:343956,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5738 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/2-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;61809d16-8694-4643-8228-59f5f36c8959&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FHnfHbhD4LobhadxCyEllCnF1gtc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;HnfHbhD4LobhadxCyEllCnF1gtc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:343956,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GVIsdon5toQANgxs5rxluI4Ng8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Truy c\u1eadp K\u00eanh Ng\u01b0\u1eddi B\u00e1n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PA5hdsLTNoHJSoxkDTtldPnzghe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o K\u00eanh Ng\u01b0\u1eddi B\u00e1n (Shopee Seller Center) \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y ngay tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c truy c\u1eadp tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp b\u1eb1ng m\u00e1y t\u00ednh qua tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t web.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VXmLdCzbvo3nsnxWiRXlYEZggTd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 &#8220;trung t\u00e2m&#8221; c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean Shopee, n\u01a1i b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 t\u1eeb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n. Ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t hai b\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1eeda ch\u1eb7ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee r\u1ed3i \u0111\u1ea5y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Z8pNdcPeeo4fYPx1fWflnrrPgOf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0b4d7335-d0dd-4e0d-bed8-0c9f520b9df2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FR4i7baxedowHhUxyiJZl4U2hgzd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;R4i7baxedowHhUxyiJZl4U2hgzd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:178282,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5737 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/3-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0b4d7335-d0dd-4e0d-bed8-0c9f520b9df2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FR4i7baxedowHhUxyiJZl4U2hgzd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;R4i7baxedowHhUxyiJZl4U2hgzd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:178282,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>Truy c\u1eadp K\u00eanh Ng\u01b0\u1eddi B\u00e1n<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ANl6dlIDZolzoHxqdeKlBbPmgfh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n cho Shop<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SXePdQukgoSSFvxuHizlI65yg0f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 shop c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u1edf n\u00ean chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady, \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u00fac b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng tin c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n. H\u00e3y truy c\u1eadp m\u1ee5c &#8220;H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 Shop&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt t\u00ean shop, \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n, banner v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 shop. T\u00ean shop n\u00ean ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, d\u1ec5 nh\u1edb v\u00e0 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UJYZdLfExoX1TtxSCj8ljQTYgje\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ph\u1ea7n m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 shop c\u0169ng r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng, h\u00e3y vi\u1ebft m\u1ed9t \u0111o\u1ea1n gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u1ec1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ho\u1eb7c cam k\u1ebft ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1ed1t v\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-WCrZd8GFGom0OFxtEZZlaT15gkb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e929e79a-2a8a-462f-8d06-5a16a4c612be&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FFeIZbKX5MoOPqtxrHvIl4NkPgEg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;FeIZbKX5MoOPqtxrHvIl4NkPgEg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:250783,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5736 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/4-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e929e79a-2a8a-462f-8d06-5a16a4c612be&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FFeIZbKX5MoOPqtxrHvIl4NkPgEg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;FeIZbKX5MoOPqtxrHvIl4NkPgEg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:250783,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n cho Shop<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SooBdftN5oJBQExbyczllhUlgRd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UDThdIIcMobTCzxrqoRl8nzDgmf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch su\u00f4n s\u1ebb. B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. H\u00e3y ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 kho h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c nh\u00e0 ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c. Sau \u0111\u00f3, l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n th\u1ea5y thu\u1eadn ti\u1ec7n nh\u1ea5t, Shopee s\u1ebd li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi h\u1ecd \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 b\u1ea1n giao nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-XL8Bdb2aFod61txckCalm5PXgyf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1cadb011-7cce-4970-913c-fe3a32b6277e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FHbqMbwWCrohyjKxkeHTlraFogvd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;HbqMbwWCrohyjKxkeHTlraFogvd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:274368,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5735 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/5-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1cadb011-7cce-4970-913c-fe3a32b6277e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FHbqMbwWCrohyjKxkeHTlraFogvd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;HbqMbwWCrohyjKxkeHTlraFogvd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:274368,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-APlPdRKyZojscJxVA9ClenThgDh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: \u0110\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NYVndWPquoyQK9xX4PXl7XtEgje\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng v\u00e0 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u00fa v\u1ecb nh\u1ea5t. Sau khi \u0111\u00e3 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, b\u1ea1n h\u00e3y v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c &#8220;Th\u00eam s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1edbi&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u. H\u00e3y \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt. Sau \u0111\u00f3, \u0111i\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 t\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 chi ti\u1ebft, gi\u00e1 b\u00e1n v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hqt3d4jBPovTWBxiFX3lzjn3gOH\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c n\u1eefa l\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean s\u00e0n. Ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c n\u1eafm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee r\u1ed3i \u0111\u1ea5y!<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-G5lddulYCoMB13x6KzdlfCJWgLf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e3694418-28b5-4cf5-bddf-022e7a864b88&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCOimb0z1No4rMvx9Bv0lvBnigFe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;COimb0z1No4rMvx9Bv0lvBnigFe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:359822,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5734 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/6.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/6-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/6-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/6-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/6-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e3694418-28b5-4cf5-bddf-022e7a864b88&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCOimb0z1No4rMvx9Bv0lvBnigFe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;COimb0z1No4rMvx9Bv0lvBnigFe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:359822,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>\u0110\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QNFqdJtsmoZcJJxMwZKlr8TvgAb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1eb9o t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng Shopee hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MYkndQs4Hos8BfxcGXUlJmepg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc t\u1ea1o gian h\u00e0ng, gi\u1edd l\u00e0 l\u00fac b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng m\u1eb9o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n l\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec1u \u0111\u00f3:<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-CXCBdlt0QoP4zRx3M95luoL1gSd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e130d08f-3c2a-4f39-b128-59ce56381abe&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAvIdb9gxeoO8J1xzi9HlHXcngej%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AvIdb9gxeoO8J1xzi9HlHXcngej&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:623345,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5733 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e130d08f-3c2a-4f39-b128-59ce56381abe&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAvIdb9gxeoO8J1xzi9HlHXcngej%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AvIdb9gxeoO8J1xzi9HlHXcngej&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:623345,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>M\u1eb9o t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng Shopee hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-OALmdi3OYok0OnxGTxClw3XAgdc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xgjld3iqfoMSzkxVrMgl37SOgag\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd g\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean. V\u00ec th\u1ebf, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh th\u1eadt \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 r\u00f5 n\u00e9t. H\u00e3y ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh \u1edf n\u01a1i c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ee7 \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng, t\u1eeb nhi\u1ec1u g\u00f3c \u0111\u1ed9 kh\u00e1c nhau \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng d\u1ec5 h\u00ecnh dung. V\u1ec1 ph\u1ea7n m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, h\u00e3y vi\u1ebft th\u1eadt chi ti\u1ebft, trung th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. \u0110\u1eebng qu\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-KvISdeJ1QoelSfxH2JllpGTWgOd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trang tr\u00ed gian h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TdFmdjV9joGQKBxtbvwlE70wgFd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trang tr\u00ed g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng, chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p s\u1ebd t\u1ea1o ni\u1ec1m tin r\u1ea5t l\u1edbn cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. H\u00e3y coi gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng v\u1eadt l\u00fd, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd mu\u1ed1n n\u00f3 tr\u00f4ng th\u1eadt ch\u1ec9n chu. B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf logo v\u00e0 banner \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n th\u1eadt \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m theo danh m\u1ee5c khoa h\u1ecdc. M\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 giao di\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb9p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 thu h\u00fat m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 nghi\u00eam t\u00fac c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c kinh doanh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-O6RcdpR0eo2tRpxhfCTlHdsfgtd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6b72c36c-f01b-43ff-8627-e08beac05167&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKVMNbhOuEo9oWqxZq0nlS724gkh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KVMNbhOuEo9oWqxZq0nlS724gkh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1048828,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5732 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/8.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/8-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/8-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/8-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/8-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6b72c36c-f01b-43ff-8627-e08beac05167&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKVMNbhOuEo9oWqxZq0nlS724gkh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KVMNbhOuEo9oWqxZq0nlS724gkh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1048828,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>Trang tr\u00ed gian h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GQLgdDnoOoGfbJxWNFmlXTBGgZf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 Marketing c\u1ee7a Shopee<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HsoIdwLVnovqrGxacbQlD5Hvgkf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf qua c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1eeb Shopee. H\u00e3y t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng ch\u00fang \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng l\u01b0u l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0 ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n b\u1ea1n n\u00ean th\u1eed l\u00e0 m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i theo ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c theo th\u00e1ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NIbBdtjiwoHx41xNw9IlAFvrggH\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo\u00e0i ra, vi\u1ec7c tham gia c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch l\u1edbn c\u1ee7a Shopee c\u0169ng l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch r\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb. Th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u1eefng m\u1eb9o n\u00e0y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch b\u1ea1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng Shopee \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cao nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OoEwdp4uro7V5Vxy05ulUQXFgcb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mb7ndCluqoODv1xOka7l7CMWgWc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi \u0111\u00e3 ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc tr\u00ean v\u00e0 n\u1eafm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eefng m\u1eb9o t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng, b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kinh doanh. Tuy nhi\u00ean, n\u1ebfu c\u00f2n b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 b\u0103n kho\u0103n n\u00e0o, h\u00e3y xem ngay ph\u1ea7n gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e1p nh\u1eefng th\u1eafc m\u1eafc ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u1ea5t d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-PzkYdkuZko362hxOVCnl2usIgce\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6e386aa6-65a5-4bc3-bcc2-7b4207903903&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVkt9bPlaPoPP5oxwtbylMM7Yg4b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Vkt9bPlaPoPP5oxwtbylMM7Yg4b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1481342,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5731 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/9.png 1280w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/9-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/9-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/9-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/9-600x338.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6e386aa6-65a5-4bc3-bcc2-7b4207903903&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1080,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1920,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVkt9bPlaPoPP5oxwtbylMM7Yg4b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Vkt9bPlaPoPP5oxwtbylMM7Yg4b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1481342,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><em>M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/em><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-W20ydtbJ2oYmFfxlCGclaveEgbC\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ea5y Shop?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CPhad1nA3oWK6ZxIEgNlpFUvgNh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a Shopee, b\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd cho m\u1ed9t shop duy nh\u1ea5t. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y nh\u1eb1m \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u00ednh b\u1ea3o m\u1eadt v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n cho c\u1ea3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n l\u1eabn s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n m\u1edf th\u00eam m\u1ed9t shop kh\u00e1c, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i m\u1edbi, ch\u01b0a t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n n\u00e0o tr\u00ean Shopee.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Www1drfZkoPnOGxKULNl5xAvgdh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee c\u00f3 m\u1ea5t ph\u00ed kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXtXd5c87oZUaHxRrS4ltKTJgJd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tin t\u1ed1t cho b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 do t\u1ea1o gian h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i chi tr\u1ea3 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed ban \u0111\u1ea7u n\u00e0o. Sau n\u00e0y, khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, Shopee s\u1ebd thu m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ecf t\u00f9y theo t\u1eebng ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ph\u00ed d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1c n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00eam c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Y5lzdg4xmoX3m4xSpbtliiuPghe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u1ea7n nh\u1eefng gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd g\u00ec \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QL5ddskEaojINnxx04NlTtzEgVe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u1ee7 t\u1ee5c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd tr\u00ean Shopee r\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng y\u00eau c\u1ea7u nhi\u1ec1u gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 C\u0103n c\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00f4ng d\u00e2n h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c minh danh t\u00ednh. Ngo\u00e0i ra, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ec3 li\u00ean h\u1ec7, c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn ti\u1ec1n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. Vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm r\u00f5 nh\u1eefng c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p khi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1ef1 tin v\u00e0 s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng h\u01a1n cho h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOlSdIxhMowYd4xdPy0lVdGeg7d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhZedCrKbo2yILxEiPWl7gSrgab\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hy v\u1ecdng r\u1eb1ng b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n n\u1eafm r\u00f5 to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 c\u00e1c m\u1eb9o \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh online kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u qu\u00e1 ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u ho\u1eb7c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh s\u1ed1, h\u00e3y li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ngay v\u1edbi <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e1p t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang c\u00f3 \u00fd \u0111\u1ecbnh kinh doanh online, ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng nh\u1ea5t. Tuy nhi\u00ean, nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\u1eabn l\u00fang t\u00fang kh\u00f4ng bi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb \u0111\u00e2u. \u0110\u1eebng lo l\u1eafng! B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea1n c\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Shopee c\u1ef1c [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5740,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[30,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5730","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-shopee","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5730","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5730"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5730\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5847,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5730\/revisions\/5847"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5740"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5730"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"ht